here strictly to approved construction plans. Encroachments on roads and footpaths must be identified and removed swiftly. Action will be taken against unauthorized constructions and waste dumping.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/visakhapatnam-civic-bodys-chief-reviews-town-planning-tdr-cases/133704382?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-154568/133704382.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}]}